#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
NyxForge XMR Swap mockup generator.
Generates docs/storyboards/out/xmr-swap-mockup.html

Haveno/Retoswap-style decentralized fiat-to-XMR exchange.
Buy XMR with PayPal, Zelle, cash by mail, bank transfer, etc.
2-of-3 multisig security deposits, no custodian, P2P.

5 frames:
  1. Offer Book    -- buy-XMR offers, filter by payment method, offer table
  2. Take Offer    -- enter trade amount, review terms and security deposit
  3. Active Trade  -- funds locked, payment instructions, confirm sent
  4. Complete      -- XMR released, trade closed
  5. Create Offer  -- maker form: payment method, price, amount, deposit
"""
